<%- include('../partials/head', { heading: 'System', narrow: true }) %>

<div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-bottom:1.1rem">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat__label">Database size</div><div class="stat__value"><%= dbSize %></div></div>
  <div class="stat">
    <div class="stat__label">Last backup</div>
    <div class="stat__value" style="font-size:1.05rem"><%= lastBackup ? fmtDateTime(lastBackup.created_at) : 'None yet' %></div>
    <div class="stat__meta"><a href="/admin/backup">Backup &amp; restore</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat__label">Running for</div><div class="stat__value"><%= uptimeHours %> h</div><div class="stat__meta">Node <%= node %></div></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card__head"><h2>What is in the system</h2></div>
  <div class="card__body card__body--flush table-wrap">
    <table class="data">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Rooms</td><td class="num"><%= stats.rooms %></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Guests</td><td class="num"><%= stats.guests %></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Bookings</td><td class="num"><%= stats.bookings %></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Food orders</td><td class="num"><%= stats.orders %></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Invoices</td><td class="num"><%= stats.invoices %></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Staff logins</td><td class="num"><%= stats.users %></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card__head"><h2>Letting other PCs and tablets in</h2></div>
  <div class="card__body">
    <p>Staff on the hotel network open the system in any browser. On this PC use
      <span class="mono">http://localhost:8080</span>; on other devices use this PC's network address,
      for example <span class="mono">http://192.168.1.50:8080</span>, the exact addresses are printed
      in the black window when the system starts.</p>
    <p class="mb-0 muted"><small>If another device cannot connect. It is almost always the Windows Firewall.
      Allow inbound TCP on the port for Private networks, and check both devices are on the same wifi.</small></p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
